# The house style is the "prettier" key of package.json (this directory; it was
# .prettierrc until v1.21.3) and is inherited by every
# workspace that has no config of its own — packages/*, root scripts/, and the
# matrix-bot and mcp-server apps. Before it existed, `prettier --write` on any of
# those applied prettier's DEFAULTS (two-space indent, double quotes, 80 columns)
# and mangled the file while reporting success. apps/web keeps its own config for
# its Svelte and Tailwind plugins; the other apps' copies are identical to this.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.svelte-kit/
package-lock.json
# Machine-maintained: the i18n parity smokes are the gate, and they are tab-indented.
apps/web/src/lib/i18n/locales/
apps/web/static/
